definitionOfDone:
`cd packages/moe-daemon && npx vitest run src/tools/chatChannelRef.test.ts`, run in a snapshot outside the shared checkout, passes. It has new cases that fail on HEAD b5f40fee:
- chat_who lists the same seats for a channel's id, its bare name and "#name";
- chat_join on "#general" posts its join line in #general;
- chat_resync on "#general" resets the cursor keyed by #general's id and sets it again;
- chat_who, chat_join and chat_resync each refuse a channel that does not exist with -32001 NOT_FOUND.

`npx vitest run src/tools/chatBudgets.test.ts` passes with a new case that fails on HEAD. In it, chat_resync with maxContentChars 0, over messages whose total chatMessageResponseCost exceeds MAX_CHAT_RESPONSE_CHARS:
- returns at most that budget;
- keeps the newest messages;
- leaves the caller's cursor for that channel on the newest message it returned.
